  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among Lang Ya blessed land’s three true inheritances is Thieving Heaven’s, and rank eight Steal Life Immortal Gu is part of it.",
      "chapters": [
        1758
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "gu_steal_life_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While researching venerable true inheritances, Fang Yuan finds Giant Sun’s self luck true inheritance comprehensive and Thieving Heaven’s short. Steal Life Immortal Gu steals lifespan dao marks and can reduce a person’s lifespan. Thieving Heaven’s final words state that normal use steals others’ lifespan, that a killer move can increase one’s own (inferior to lifespan Gu), and that reverse use giving the user’s lifespan to another target is the deepest essence of this true inheritance. Reaching that step would remove Thieving Heaven’s method on the Gu and yield information of another corresponding true inheritance. Even if Fang Yuan destroyed Steal Life Immortal Gu, the true inheritance still holds the rank eight recipe, and he judges that comprehending the core essence would outweigh his present gains.",
      "chapters": [
        1782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "inh_self_luck_true_inheritance",
        "gu_lifespan_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After gaining results in comprehending the Steal Life true inheritance, Fang Yuan can specify the intended target for great thief ghost hand to steal, and when he knows the target and where their Immortal Gu are, he can steal Immortal Gu every time.",
      "chapters": [
        1790
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "great-thief-targeting",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_great_thief_ghost_hand",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan deduces wisdom grasp after referencing great thief ghost hand and the steal life true inheritance; great thief ghost hand steals Immortal Gu while wisdom grasp steals lives and kills instantly.",
      "chapters": [
        1802
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
